# Exception: the openrouter_checks duplicate-check corpus (seeded reference
# images + the DB that indexes them) is committed on purpose, so a fresh
# clone starts with the same corpus rather than an empty one. Tradeoff
# accepted: binary images + a SQLite file in git bloat over time, and the DB
# file will conflict on every seed if more than one clone seeds it.
!openrouter_checks/kyv_checks.sqlite3
